{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["# Day 60 — Capstone completion & presentation\n","Objectives:\n","- Finalize model and data pipeline.\n","- Prepare results notebook and README.\n","- Create presentation-ready visuals and a short slide deck (outline).\n","- Provide reproducible run instructions."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Final deliverables checklist\n","- [ ] Clean, versioned dataset (or reproducible loader).\n","- [ ] Training notebook/script + modules in `src/`.\n","- [ ] Evaluation notebook with clear metrics and comparisons.\n","- [ ] Saved artifacts (`models/`) and `requirements.txt`.\n","- [ ] README with:\n","  - Problem statement and constraints\n","  - Data description and quality notes\n","  - Modeling approach and key decisions\n","  - How to reproduce and how to serve (API/Docker optional)\n","- [ ] Optional: MLflow experiment logs and model registry entry.\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Presentation outline (slides)\n","1) Problem & impact (1–2 slides)\n","2) Data & EDA highlights (2–3 slides)\n","3) Approach & baselines (2 slides)\n","4) Final model & metrics (2–3 slides)\n","5) Error analysis & limitations (1–2 slides)\n","6) Next steps & roadmap (1 slide)\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Reproducibility instructions\n","- Create venv and install requirements.\n","- Run training with provided script/notebook.\n","- Evaluate and reproduce plots.\n","- (Optional) Launch API container with Dockerfile.\n","\n","Example:\n","```bash\n","python3 -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate\n","pip install -r requirements.txt\n","python -m src.data.load   # or notebooks/EDA.ipynb\n","python -m src.model.train # or notebooks/train.ipynb\n","python -m src.model.eval  # or notebooks/evaluate.ipynb\n","```\n","\n","## Congratulations!\n","Wrap up your learnings: write 3 takeaways and 1 open question below."]}]}
